html = html.replace('Detailed trade statistics · 2019–2026', 'Combo account · detailed trade statistics · 2019–2026')
(OUT/'trade-statistics.html').write_text(html.replace('__DATA__',json.dumps(data,separators=(',',':'),allow_nan=False)),encoding='utf-8')
readme='''AI FOREX TRADER — DETAILED BACKTEST STATISTICS (prepared 2026-10-06)

Open trade-statistics.html for the complete searchable report, including method,
yearly summary, monthly heatmap and every week/day. Works without Internet.

7,646 strategy-selected trades are reported in NET R by entry UTC period.
6,509 simulated account trades are reported in USD and compounded percentages.
Account entries use entry periods; closures, wins/losses, costs and returns use exit periods.
Calendar periods use UTC; weeks use ISO Monday–Sunday week-year labels.
Broker daily table uses New York 17:00 cutoff and the next date label.
2026 ends September 30. October–December are unavailable, not zero.
Net USD P&L already includes commission and slippage; do not subtract these again.
Null PF means no losing results in that period; blank win rate means no trades.
Both complete trade ledgers include UTC, New York and IST timestamps.
stats.json contains source hashes, exact summary, account settings and all periods.
All counts, account balances and yearly returns reconcile with the existing dashboard.
No source/model data was changed. Historical news coverage ends 2025-04-04.
'''
